.el .ds Aq '
.TH show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
show \- Show one cloud snippet in full
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshow\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one cloud snippet in full
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
`owner/name`, or a bare name for your own snippet
